      <ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[prefetch 8C7972B787C6B9FC7DF4DE39B0CA5A21B02BD316.dmg sha1:8C7972B787C6B9FC7DF4DE39B0CA5A21B02BD316 size:55551594 https://download.mozilla.org/?product=firefox-latest-ssl&os=osx&lang=en-US sha256:DE65A85080F8A9423ABA4C1AE498687568EF948CF97DCC6DD666C6EE67480A0A

